      "content": "We collected human airway epithelium biopsies at three stages of a viral challenge study: baseline, day 3 and day 10, with 14 volunteers sampled at each stage, 42 samples in all. I have the expression matrix, a motif prior and a PPI table. I want one TF-to-gene network per stage, each built from all 14 samples of that stage, not networks for single samples."
